{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t大埔宏福苑火災發生接近一年，社署「一戶一社工」一直跟進居民的需要。有社工表示，有居民最初情緒低落不願外出，現時會主動約朋友見面，變得更堅強。<br/>\n<br/>\n亦有社工指，有居民反映近期浮現不同片段，需要協助調整心情。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：詹可揚\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T12:03:50.899587+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T11:43:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T16:51:34.388386+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T11:57:20.017897+00:00","content_hash":"f08618595681dbeda76be574862527fdc5b6c1d63570e37e5e486267617b4c24","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}